{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe road from Abersau was tedious, but Töplitz is a strange place. I lodged at the *König von Preussen*, a new house, and the room is cool, which I prefer to the stifling heat of the spa. I climbed the Schlackenberg as Fräulein Stok advised; the view is adequate, the air sharp. I drank the waters in the Spitalgarten—they taste of iron and regret, but I swallowed them for the sake of the routine. Later, I strolled Prince Clary’s park, which is overgrown and lacks the discipline of a Berlin garden, and took the Steinbad. It was hot, as stones are.\n\nDinner was serviceable. A roast duck, heavy but acceptable, and a local white wine that lacked backbone. I paid twelve kreuzer for a glass. The people here are polite but shallow, all talking of cures and carriage rides. I think of you and the boys in the quiet of the evening. The world outside is loud, but here, in the water, one’s thoughts settle. I shall write again soon.\n\nYour husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219006,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":247,"prompt_tokens":1125,"total_tokens":1372,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ze8sK2xOIPwL2seNamkm8ggszvGxlmX6","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1125,"prompt_ms":1199.193,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0659493333333334,"prompt_per_second":938.1308930255597,"predicted_n":247,"predicted_ms":5888.454,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.93680487804878,"predicted_per_second":41.77667007333334}}